{
    "title": "Loosid: Sober Dating & Meetups",
    "description": "The Best Sober Dating. Bar. None\u2122\r\n\r\nOvercome sobriety\u2019s toughest challenges for singles \u2013 dating. Conquer sobriety with that special someone on Loosid\u2019s Sober Dating.\r\n\r\nSince 2018, Loosid has initiated over 9.14M sessions and fostered more than 155,000 sober relationships.\r\n\r\nHIGHLIGHTS\r\n\r\n-Match with local sober singles near you\r\n-Chat with your matches\r\n-Stand out with Flirt and SuperLike\r\n-Spot secret admirers\r\n-Bookmark & keep track of profiles that catch your eye\r\n\r\nSOBER QUESTIONS\r\n\r\nNavigating sobriety as a single person is tough \u2013 we know. Which is why we created Sober Questions to help you find what you\u2019re looking for!:\r\n\r\n- My idea of a perfect Sober Saturday?\r\n- The biggest gift sobriety has given to me is?\r\n- My favorite mocktail is?\r\n\r\n\r\nCHECK OUT THE LOOSID COMMUNITY \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re years in your sobriety, relapsing, sober curious, or even a friend of someone starting their journey \u2013 our sober community is here for support:\r\n\r\nHIGHLIGHTS:\r\n-Sober tracker & counter\r\n-Chat & meet other sober individuals \r\n-Make addiction recovery easier\r\n-Reframe your mentality around drinking less or quitting your vice\r\n-S.A.M.: Smart recovery mentor\r\n-Count your days clean\r\n-Celebrate addiction recovery milestones\r\n-Meet new sober friends  \r\n\r\nNeed help? Use our crisis hotline for immediate help and support.\r\n\r\n\r\nLoosid is a revolutionary dating app designed for people who are sober or who are seeking to lead a sober lifestyle. This app is perfect for those who are looking to find love, companionship or even friends \u2013 especially in their sobriety & addiction recovery.  \r\n\r\n\r\nWhether you're just starting your sober journey or well on your way, Loosid is the perfect dating app to help you stay on track and find the love of your life. Join for free today! \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://loosidapp.com/contact-us/",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Best Sober Dating. Bar. None\u2122<br><br>Overcome sobriety\u2019s toughest challenges for singles \u2013 dating. Conquer sobriety with that special someone on Loosid\u2019s Sober Dating.<br><br>Since 2018, Loosid has initiated over 9.14M sessions and fostered more than 155,000 sober relationships.<br><br>HIGHLIGHTS<br><br>-Match with local sober singles near you<br>-Chat with your matches<br>-Stand out with Flirt and SuperLike<br>-Spot secret admirers<br>-Bookmark &amp; keep track of profiles that catch your eye<br><br>SOBER QUESTIONS<br><br>Navigating sobriety as a single person is tough \u2013 we know. Which is why we created Sober Questions to help you find what you\u2019re looking for!:<br><br>- My idea of a perfect Sober Saturday?<br>- The biggest gift sobriety has given to me is?<br>- My favorite mocktail is?<br><br><br>CHECK OUT THE LOOSID COMMUNITY <br><br>Whether you\u2019re years in your sobriety, relapsing, sober curious, or even a friend of someone starting their journey \u2013 our sober community is here for support:<br><br>HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-Sober tracker &amp; counter<br>-Chat &amp; meet other sober individuals <br>-Make addiction recovery easier<br>-Reframe your mentality around drinking less or quitting your vice<br>-S.A.M.: Smart recovery mentor<br>-Count your days clean<br>-Celebrate addiction recovery milestones<br>-Meet new sober friends  <br><br>Need help? Use our crisis hotline for immediate help and support.<br><br><br>Loosid is a revolutionary dating app designed for people who are sober or who are seeking to lead a sober lifestyle. This app is perfect for those who are looking to find love, companionship or even friends \u2013 especially in their sobriety &amp; addiction recovery.  <br><br><br>Whether you&#39;re just starting your sober journey or well on your way, Loosid is the perfect dating app to help you stay on track and find the love of your life. Join for free today! <br><br><br>https://loosidapp.com/contac